Scope of this license

This license covers only the files that docs/file-origins.json lists with
origins AE, AE-RUN, T1 or T2 and no other origin: files written for agent-ee or
produced by its runs from such files (AE, AE-RUN), the RC filter fixture copied
from FOME-MC (T1) and the validation logic in src/agent_ee/checks.py adapted
from FOME-MC toolchain/eda.py (T2). An owner decision of 2026-10-22, relayed by
the coordinator, approved MIT for these origins and gave the owner as sole
author of T1 and T2; docs/decisions.md and each origin's owner_record quote
the relay. Stock KiCad library data embedded in the RC fixture keeps its own
license (origin T6); the inventory reports those files as derived.

It grants no rights in any file with another origin. Those files come from, or
are derived from, other projects or parties, including FOME-Tech, rusEFI,
KiCad, mck1117/wideband, semiconductor vendors, distributors, three.js and the
public boards named in benchmarks/seeded/, and they include the evidence
archives and the fome-mc reference block captures under fixtures/fome-mc/.
These files are not offered under this license. docs/file-origins.json lists
each one with its origin, known upstream license and publication status, and
docs/third-party-origins.md summarizes them.
